---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<BaseLayout title="Offline - TaskPilot">
  <div class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="w-full max-w-md bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-slate-100 p-8 text-center">
      <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-indigo-100 rounded-2xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-4">
        📡
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-800">Kamu sedang offline</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
        Sepertinya koneksi internet terputus. Halaman yang kamu buka butuh koneksi
        untuk memuat data tugas terbaru dari server.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-2">
        <button
          type="button"
          onclick="window.location.reload()"
          class="w-full py-3 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-bold text-sm rounded-xl transition shadow-md shadow-indigo-200 cursor-pointer"
        >
          Coba Lagi
        </button>
        <a
          href="/dashboard"
          class="w-full py-3 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-bold text-sm rounded-xl transition"
        >
          Kembali ke Dashboard
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-6">
        Tips: install TaskPilot sebagai aplikasi agar bisa dibuka lebih cepat dari layar utama.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
